"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0.29in;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: -0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Wingdings;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;text-indent: 0;width: 0.292in;"><strong></strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>学科素养为先，全面发展</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">生物竞赛不仅需要博览群书，更加需要用类比思维对进行比较、用演绎推理的思维进行科学论证，用批判性的思维来审视现有的知识，极大程度地锻炼了学生的思维。另外，对动手能力的要求也较高，极度考验学生的耐心、细心和应变能力</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。竞赛学子们在范捷老师、刘军霞老师、王佩金老师的指导下，还积极参加了多项综合实践活动，</span><span style="color: #C00000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>有两项研究性学习成果分别获绍兴市一等奖、三等奖。</strong></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">因此，竞赛课程的学习可以</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">极大程度</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">提升</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学生的</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">生物学科核心素养</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">和解决问题的</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;marg